pmem: Universal Smart, Fast & Beautiful Process Memory Explorer & RAM Profiler

Features:
- Detects all processes and sorts them by RAM usage (RSS) with colorful visual meters
- System RAM and Swap summary gauges with detailed breakdown
- Grouping mode (-g, --group) to aggregate multi-process applications (Chrome, Firefox, Electron, etc.)
- Interactive FZF explorer (-i, --fzf) with deep inspection preview and process management
- Live auto-refresh watch dashboard (-w, --watch [interval])
- Powerful search and filtering by process name, user, or command line
- Machine-readable JSON export mode (--json)
- Automatic ANSI color detection with pipeline support
"""
